## Must-have improvements
- Use backend-driven OAuth2/OIDC, not raw username/password auth if possible
- Add refresh-token rotation
- Implement certificate pinning in OkHttp
- Detect rooted devices / compromised environments where appropriate
- Prevent screenshots on sensitive screens
- Use biometric re-auth for high-risk actions
- Add session timeout and app lock
- Never log tokens, balances, PII, or credentials
- Add Play Integrity API / device attestation
- Add strong server-side fraud controls
- Add encrypted Room database if storing sensitive local data
- Add secure input handling and anti-overlay protections
- Add rate limiting and account lockout on backend
- Add transaction signing / step-up authentication for transfers
- Add full test coverage and security review

