# 14. Important security note

This implementation is only a **UI and architecture starter**. It is **not secure enough for real banking use**.

Do not ship a real banking app without:

- OAuth2 / OpenID Connect or equivalent secure auth
- TLS pinning strategy where appropriate
- EncryptedSharedPreferences / Android Keystore
- Secure token refresh
- Root/jailbreak detection strategy
- Device binding
- Audit logging
- Backend-side authorization
- Anti-tampering protections

