Example upsert query:

```sql
INSERT INTO surveys (id, title, location, notes, updated_at, deleted)
VALUES ($1, $2, $3, $4, $5, $6)
ON CONFLICT (id)
DO UPDATE SET
  title = EXCLUDED.title,
  location = EXCLUDED.location,
  notes = EXCLUDED.notes,
  updated_at = EXCLUDED.updated_at,
  deleted = EXCLUDED.deleted
WHERE surveys.updated_at <= EXCLUDED.updated_at;
