# Architecture

## Client
- Stores surveys locally in SQLite
- Every local change is written immediately to local DB
- Changes are added to a `sync_queue`
- When online, app sends queued changes to server
- App also pulls newer server changes

## Server
- Stores canonical survey records
- Accepts batched changes from clients
- Returns updates newer than client’s last sync timestamp

