# 6. How sync works

## Offline create/update flow
1. User creates a survey
2. App saves it to IndexedDB immediately
3. App adds an outbox item
4. UI updates instantly
5. If offline, nothing else happens yet

## Reconnect flow
1. Browser fires `online`
2. `syncNow()` runs
3. Pending outbox items are pushed to server
4. Server applies them
5. Client marks outbox items as synced
6. Client pulls latest server changes since last sync
7. Local IndexedDB is updated

