- encrypted transport via HTTPS

## F. Attachments/photos/GPS
Field apps often need:
- camera integration
- GPS coordinates
- offline map tiles
- media upload queue separate from record queue

## G. Better sync batching
Instead of one request per queue item:
- send many queued changes in one `/sync/batch` request
