# 10. Important Notes

This is a **starter template**, not a fully hardened production app.

Especially important:
- Never trust client-side premium flags
- Verify Stripe webhooks securely
- Authenticate socket connections
- Avoid emitting all events globally
- Add authorization checks so users can only access their own conversations

