# 6. Unlock paid messages properly

Right now the UI always shows locked paid messages. To actually unlock them per user, add an endpoint like:

```js
router.get('/:messageId/access', authMiddleware, async (req, res) => {
  const messageId = Number(req.params.messageId);

  const purchase = await prisma.purchase.findFirst({
    where: {
      userId: req.user.id,
      messageId
    }
  });

  const message = await prisma.message.findUnique({
    where: { id: messageId }
  });

  if (!message) return res.status(404).json({ error: 'Message not found' });

  const canView =
    !message.isPaid ||
    message.senderId === req.user.id ||
    purchase;

  if (!canView) {
    return res.status(403).json({ error: 'Locked' });
  }

  res.json({ content: message.content });
});
