## What this implementation does

### Real-time visualization
- A line chart updates every 2 seconds
- Metric cards change dynamically
- Activity log receives simulated events

### Form handling
- Validates required fields
- Ensures numeric input for value
- Adds submitted events to the activity log
- Updates metrics and chart based on submitted data

### Responsive dashboard layout
- Uses CSS Grid
- Collapses to single-column on smaller screens

