## How it works

### Data model
- `symbols`: stock rows
- `timeBuckets`: number of columns
- `data[row][col]`: percent price change for a stock at a time bucket

### Real-time updates
- Every second:
  - each stock row shifts left
  - a new value is appended
- This creates a scrolling time-series heatmap effect

### Zoom and pan
- Mouse wheel changes `scale`
- Dragging changes `offsetX` / `offsetY`

### Rendering
- Canvas is used instead of DOM cells for better performance
- Only visible labels/cells are drawn when possible

