# Important limitations in this starter

## 1. No database
All data is stored in memory, so restarting the server resets everything.

## 2. No authentication
Anyone connected can modify everything.

## 3. Basic drag-and-drop
This supports moving tasks between columns, but not precise reordering within a column by mouse position.

## 4. No conflict resolution
If multiple users edit the same task at the same time, last write wins.

