- Kanban-style board with columns:
  - Todo
  - In Progress
  - Done
- Drag-and-drop using native HTML5 drag events
- Real-time updates via WebSocket

## Backend
- Node.js + Express
- WebSocket server using `ws`
- In-memory project/task state
- Broadcast updates to all connected clients

## Collaboration model
When a user:
- creates a task
- edits a task
- moves a task between columns
- reorders tasks

the frontend sends an event to the server, and the server:
- updates canonical state
- broadcasts the new state to all clients

