# 7. Important notes about this initial version

## Drag-and-drop limitation
This implementation supports dragging tasks over other tasks. Dropping into an empty column is not fully handled yet because the column itself is not a droppable target.

## State mutation issue
In `Board.tsx`, the code currently mutates `board.columns[sourceColumnId].taskIds` during same-column reorder. In React, props should not be mutated. Since the server emits the canonical updated board, this may appear to work, but it should be fixed in the next iteration.

## No persistence
All data is stored in memory. Restarting the server resets the board.

## No concurrency safeguards
If multiple users move tasks at the same time, last-write-wins behavior applies.

