# Limitations of this initial implementation

This starter has several intentional simplifications:

- Data is stored in memory only
  - restarting server loses everything
- No authentication or permissions
- No database
- No conflict resolution for simultaneous edits
- Drag-and-drop only supports moving to top of another column
- No task reordering within same column
- No presence indicators
- No activity log
- No optimistic UI/error handling
- No validation beyond basics

