# 9. Optional improved real-time event model

Instead of REST + WebSocket broadcast-only, you can use WebSocket mutations directly:

Client sends:
```json
{
  "type": "MOVE_TASK",
  "payload": {
    "taskId": "task-1",
    "sourceColumnId": "col-1",
    "destinationColumnId": "col-2",
    "destinationIndex": 0
  }
}
```

Server responds/broadcasts:
```json
{
  "type": "TASK_MOVED",
  "payload": {
    "taskId": "task-1",
    "sourceColumnId": "col-1",
    "destinationColumnId": "col-2",
    "destinationIndex": 0,
    "version": 12
  }
}
```

That is a better long-term design.

