# 7. Production-grade message model

Instead of passing raw structs ad hoc, define canonical events:

```rust
pub enum Event {
    MarketTick(MarketTick),
    OrderIntent(OrderRequest),
    OrderApproved(ApprovedOrder),
    OrderSent { order_id: u64, ts: i64 },
    ExecutionReport(ExecutionReport),
    PositionUpdated { instrument_id: u64, pos: i64, ts: i64 },
    RiskRejected { reason: String, ts: i64 },
}
```

This makes:
- replay easier
- debugging easier
- service boundaries cleaner

