# Better scalable design

A more future-proof event flow:

```text
MarketDataGateway -> MarketDataBus -> StrategyEngine
StrategyEngine -> OrderIntentBus -> RiskEngine
RiskEngine -> ApprovedOrderBus -> OMS
OMS -> ExecutionCommandBus -> ExecutionGateway
ExecutionGateway -> ExecutionReportBus -> OMS / Position / Risk
PositionService -> PositionBus
```

This avoids ambiguous routing and makes it easier to split into services later.

