Critical for debugging and backtesting.

## G. Add kill switch and operator controls
- global trading halt
- per-strategy disable
- per-symbol disable

## H. Add authentication/authorization
For API and operator actions.

## I. Add latency instrumentation
Track:
- market event ingress time
