# 4. Design Principles

- Event-driven core
- Single-writer ownership per stateful component where possible
- Avoid shared mutable state
- Use bounded queues
- Prefer pre-allocation in hot paths
- Separate hot path from slow path
- Persist asynchronously, not inline with order send path
- Make every event timestamped
- Build replayability from day one

