# 9. Important Improvements Before Production

This code is a starting point, not production-ready. Before real trading, add:

## Reliability
- Structured error handling
- Graceful shutdown
- Backpressure handling
- Dead-letter queues or reject handling
- Sequence numbers on events
- Idempotency keys

## Risk
- Position limits by instrument/strategy/account
- Notional limits
- Fat-finger checks
- Price band validation
- Trading session controls
- Kill switch
- Self-trade prevention

## OMS/Execution
- Cancel/replace support
- Exchange order state reconciliation
- Partial fill handling
- Retry policy
- Drop copy support
- FIX support

## Persistence
- Write-ahead event log
- PostgreSQL schema for orders/fills/positions
- Recovery/replay on startup
- Snapshotting

## Performance
- Replace broadcast channel with lower-latency queue/ring buffer
- Avoid JSON in hot path
- Use binary encoding
