# 4. Routing strategy

```java
package hfmsg;

public interface RoutingStrategy {
    int route(MessageEvent event, int destinationCount);
}
```

Hash-based routing:

```java
package hfmsg;

public final class HashRoutingStrategy implements RoutingStrategy {
    @Override
    public int route(MessageEvent event, int destinationCount) {
        int h = Integer.hashCode(event.partitionKey);
        h ^= (h >>> 16);
        return (h & Integer.MAX_VALUE) % destinationCount;
    }
}
```

Topic-based routing:

```java
package hfmsg;

public final class TopicRoutingStrategy implements RoutingStrategy {
    @Override
    public int route(MessageEvent event, int destinationCount) {
        return Math.floorMod(event.topicId, destinationCount);
    }
}
```

