# Example: batch worker processing

Instead of processing one message at a time:

```rust
fn worker_batch_loop(rx: Receiver<Message>) {
    let mut batch = Vec::with_capacity(1024);

    loop {
        batch.clear();

        if let Ok(msg) = rx.recv() {
            batch.push(msg);
        }

        while let Ok(msg) = rx.try_recv() {
            batch.push(msg);
            if batch.len() >= 1024 {
                break;
            }
        }

        for msg in &batch {
            // route/deliver
        }
    }
}
```

Batching often improves cache locality and throughput.

