## How to adapt filtering

You can modify `packet_allowed()` to support:

- TCP instead of UDP
- IP prefix matching
- VLAN filtering
- MAC allow/deny lists
- Stateless ACLs

Example: allow TCP dst port 443 instead of UDP 9000:

```c
if (ip->next_proto_id != IPPROTO_TCP)
    return false;

struct rte_tcp_hdr *tcp =
    (struct rte_tcp_hdr *)((uint8_t *)ip + ihl);

if (rte_be_to_cpu_16(tcp->dst_port) != 443)
    return false;
```

