## Performance tuning checklist

- Disable frequency scaling / use performance governor
- Pin one worker per RX/TX queue
- Align IRQ affinity with worker CPU
- Use NIC RSS and multiple queues
- Keep input/output on same NUMA node
- Increase hugepages if your stack benefits
- Tune ring sizes and batch sizes
- Consider `XDP_DRV` mode if supported
- Avoid parsing more than necessary
- Replace copy-forwarding with same-UMEM ownership transfer where possible
- Add prefetching and branch-friendly fast paths
- Use fixed allow rules compiled into hot path if rules are static

