## Example usage

Rotate `/var/log/myapp.log` at 1 MiB, keep 3 old files, poll every 2 seconds:

```sh
./logrotated -f /var/log/myapp.log -s 1048576 -n 3 -p 2
```

Run as daemon:

```sh
./logrotated -f /var/log/myapp.log -s 1048576 -n 3 -p 2 -d
```

Force rotation:

```sh
kill -HUP <pid>
```

Stop daemon:

```sh
kill -TERM <pid>
```

