## Important operational note

This rotates by **renaming** the active log file. That works best when the log writer:

- reopens the log on `SIGHUP`, or
- opens/writes the file each time, or
- otherwise handles renamed files correctly

If the writer keeps the file descriptor open forever, it may continue writing to the renamed file (`app.log.1`) after rotation.

If you want, I can also provide one of these variants:

