## Features

- Monitors one log file
- Rotates when file size exceeds a threshold
- Keeps `N` old files:
  - `app.log`
  - `app.log.1`
  - `app.log.2`
  - ...
- Uses `rename()`-based rotation
- Low memory footprint
- Daemonizes optionally
- Handles:
  - `SIGTERM`, `SIGINT` for shutdown
  - `SIGHUP` to force rotation/reopen

