# Operational notes

## Rotation semantics
When rotating:
- `app.log.5` is removed
- `app.log.4` becomes `app.log.5`
- ...
- `app.log` becomes `app.log.1`
- a new empty `app.log` is created

## Writer behavior
If the application writing the log:
- reopens the log file after rotation: good
- keeps the old fd open: it may continue writing to `app.log.1`

This daemon does not yet signal the writer.

