# Features

- Monitors configured log files by polling
- Rotates when file size exceeds configured limit
- Renames:
  - `app.log.4 -> app.log.5`
  - `app.log.3 -> app.log.4`
  - ...
  - `app.log -> app.log.1`
- Optional truncation by recreating the base log file
- Fixed-capacity configuration arrays
- No heap allocation required for normal operation
- Can set:
  - `RLIMIT_AS`
  - `RLIMIT_DATA`
  - `RLIMIT_RSS` where supported
- Can daemonize
- Handles `SIGTERM` / `SIGINT`

