## Status request

```bash
printf '%s\n' '{"cmd":"status"}' | socat - UNIX-CONNECT:/tmp/resourced.sock
```

## Top processes

```bash
printf '%s\n' '{"cmd":"top"}' | socat - UNIX-CONNECT:/tmp/resourced.sock
```

## Kill a process

```bash
printf '%s\n' '{"cmd":"kill","pid":1234}' | socat - UNIX-CONNECT:/tmp/resourced.sock
```

## Renice a process

```bash
printf '%s\n' '{"cmd":"renice","pid":1234,"nice":10}' | socat - UNIX-CONNECT:/tmp/resourced.sock
