# Example usage

Build:

```bash
cargo build --release
```

Run:

```bash
sudo ./target/release/sysmond
```

Connect to the control socket:

```bash
nc -U /tmp/sysmond.sock
```

Then issue commands:

```text
status
metrics
kill-process cron
restart-process sshd
```

---

# Example systemd unit

Save as `/etc/systemd/system/sysmond.service`:

```ini
[Unit]
Description=System Resource Monitoring Daemon
After=network.target

[Service]
Type=simple
ExecStart=/usr/local/bin/sysmond
Restart=always
RestartSec=2
User=root

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
```

Enable and start:

```bash
sudo cp target/release/sysmond /usr/local/bin/sysmond
sudo systemctl daemon-reload
sudo systemctl enable sysmond
sudo systemctl start sysmond
sudo systemctl status sysmond
```

