## What this daemon does safely

- monitors system resource usage
- exposes metrics locally
- logs threshold violations
- can reduce CPU priority of runaway processes if explicitly enabled

## What I did not include

I did not include:
- stealth/persistence features
- remote command execution
- arbitrary process termination logic
- hidden communications
- evasion techniques

