# Possible improved architecture

A production-grade architecture might look like:

```text
NIC RX queues
   ↓
capture workers (1 per queue/core)
   ↓
per-core flow aggregation
   ↓
periodic flow flush / expiration
   ↓
export workers
   ↓
storage / alerting / analytics
```

This minimizes contention and keeps the hot path CPU-cache-friendly.

