## Features

This example firmware does:

- periodic sampling every 10 ms
- reads:
  - temperature sensor on ADC channel 0
  - light sensor on ADC channel 1
- applies:
  - moving average filter
  - min/max tracking
- converts raw ADC values to:
  - voltage
  - temperature in °C
  - light percentage
- sets alarm flags if values exceed thresholds

