## Example: better processing with IIR filter

If you want a lighter filter than moving average:

```c
static float IIR_Filter(float input)
{
    static float y = 0.0f;
    const float alpha = 0.2f;  // 0..1, lower = smoother
    y = alpha * input + (1.0f - alpha) * y;
    return y;
}
```

Then replace:

