# Example with hysteresis for alarms

To avoid alarm flickering near thresholds:

```c
#define TEMP_HIGH_SET_C    60.0f
#define TEMP_HIGH_CLEAR_C  58.0f

static bool high_alarm_state = false;

static void update_high_alarm(float temp_c)
{
    if (!high_alarm_state && temp_c >= TEMP_HIGH_SET_C)
    {
        high_alarm_state = true;
    }
    else if (high_alarm_state && temp_c <= TEMP_HIGH_CLEAR_C)
    {
        high_alarm_state = false;
    }
}
```

