# Example of converting raw ADC to engineering units

If your sensor is analog, you may want:

```c
static float Sensor_ConvertToVoltage(uint16_t raw)
{
    return (3.3f * raw) / 4095.0f;
}
```

Or temperature:

```c
static float Sensor_ConvertToTemperatureC(uint16_t raw)
{
    float voltage = (3.3f * raw) / 4095.0f;
    return (voltage - 0.5f) * 100.0f;
}
```

