# 9. Minimal pseudocode summary

```text
for each accelerometer sample:
    mag = approximate_magnitude(ax, ay, az)
    smooth_mag = low_pass(mag)
    jerk = abs(smooth_mag - prev_smooth_mag)

    push smooth_mag, jerk into sliding window

    if window full:
        mean_mag = average(window_mag)
        var_mag = variance(window_mag)
        mean_jerk = average(window_jerk)

        if mean_mag > T1 or var_mag > T2 or mean_jerk > T3:
            streak += 1
        else:
            streak = 0

        anomaly = (streak >= N)
```

