# Limitations of this sample

This is a good starting point, but it is **not a full physics engine**. It currently has:

- only **box vs ground** collision
- no box-vs-box collision detection
- simple single-contact resolution
- no sleeping
- no broadphase / narrowphase
- no constraint solver iterations

