This is a **starter implementation**, not a production engine. It currently has:

- sphere rigid bodies only
- ground-plane collision only
- no broadphase / narrowphase for body-body collisions
- simple impulse resolution
- no sleeping
- no joints / constraints
- no continuous collision detection

