- currency-specific scale validation

## Reliability
- proper outbox poller / CDC publisher
- retry policies
- dead-letter handling
- distributed tracing
- circuit breakers for downstream services
- exactly-once or effectively-once semantics where possible

## API maturity
- pagination/search endpoints
- PATCH/cancel endpoints
- richer error model
- versioned event schemas
- OpenAPI/Swagger docs

## Data model improvements
- separate payment instruction vs execution
- payment parties and addresses
