# 5. Important production considerations

This is only an initial implementation. For a real large financial institution, you would almost certainly need the following enhancements:

## Security
- OAuth2 / OIDC
- mTLS between services
- Role-based access control
- Field-level encryption for sensitive data
- Secrets management via Vault/KMS

## Compliance
- AML screening
- Sanctions screening
- KYC checks
- Regulatory reporting
- Full immutable audit trail

## Reliability
- Outbox pattern for event publishing
- Retry policies
- Dead-letter queues
- Circuit breakers for external dependencies
- Distributed tracing
- Metrics and alerting

## Data integrity
- Stronger idempotency guarantees
- Duplicate request payload hashing
- Pessimistic/optimistic locking strategy
- Ledger-first or double-entry accounting integration
- Reconciliation jobs

## Workflow
- Async processing instead of immediate completion
- Approval workflows for high-value payments
- Cutoff windows and settlement calendars
- FX handling
- Fees and charges
- Reversals and refunds

## API design
- Versioned APIs
- OpenAPI/Swagger
- Correlation IDs
- Standard error codes
- Pagination and filtering for payment search

## Testing
- Unit tests
- Integration tests
- Contract tests
- Performance/load tests
- Chaos testing

