# 16. If you want even stricter type safety

For maximum enterprise-grade type guarantees:

- use branded types for IDs and emails
- separate persistence models from domain models
- use Result/Either types instead of exceptions in domain logic
- generate API clients from OpenAPI
- generate DB types from Prisma only, never hand-write persistence shapes
- validate all external integration payloads with Zod before use

Example branded ID:

```ts
type Brand<T, B extends string> = T & { readonly __brand: B };
type CustomerId = Brand<string, 'CustomerId'>;
type ExternalCustomerId = Brand<string, 'ExternalCustomerId'>;
```

