# 16. Azure AD scopes setup

For the authorization policies above to work, define API scopes in your app registration:

- `Employees.Read`
- `Employees.Write`

Then client apps request those scopes.

If your enterprise uses **app roles** instead of scopes, change policies to:

```csharp
builder.Services.AddAuthorization(options =>
{
    options.AddPolicy("Employees.Read", policy =>
        policy.RequireRole("Employees.Read"));

    options.AddPolicy("Employees.Write", policy =>
        policy.RequireRole("Employees.Write"));
});
